{"symbol":"STF.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T19:57:53Z","info":{"address1":"ul. Rozdzienskiego 11a","city":"Dabrowa Górnicza","zip":"41-308","country":"Poland","phone":"48 32 261 6034","fax":"48 32 261 6033","website":"https://www.stalprofil.com.pl","industry":"Industrial Distribution","industryKey":"industrial-distribution","industryDisp":"Industrial Distribution","sector":"Industrials","sectorKey":"industrials","sectorDisp":"Industrials","longBusinessSummary":"Stalprofil S.A. engages in the distribution of steel products in Poland and internationally. The company provides hot rolled profiles, channels, equal-leg angles, unequal angles, and T-bars; cold formed profiles, such as square and rectangular profiles, and channels; flat, round, square, drawn, and ribbed bars, as well as wire rods; and hot and cold rolled plates, and patterned sheets. It offers normal, economical parallel, and wide flange I-beams, as well as W-shape flanges and special economical I-beams; ordinary, economical, and UPE channels; flat, hot rolled roundsteel, and squared bars; and isosceles T-Bars. In addition, the company produces and sells outer anti-corrosive insulation for steel pipes and tubes that are primarily used for the construction of transmission pipelines; and supplies pipes and tubes for gas engineering sector, as well as for fuel industry, heat engineering, water pipelines, sewage systems, and various other areas. Further, it provides steel structures assembly and painting services. Stalprofil S.A. was founded in 1988 and is based in Dabrowa Górnicza, Poland.","fullTimeEmployees":627,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Henryk  Orczykowski","age":66,"title":"President of the Management Board & CEO","yearBorn":1959,"fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":2297973,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Sylwia  Potocka-Lewicka","age":55,"title":"Vice President of Management Board & CFO","yearBorn":1970,"fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":1165434,"exercisedV